    {"n":"Blade Ward","l":0,"s":"Abjuration","c":["Bard","Sorcerer","Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"Self","cp":"VS","du":"1 round","d":"Until your next turn ends, you resist bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing damage dealt by weapon attacks.","src":"phb-2014","page":218,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Circle of Power","l":5,"s":"Abjuration","c":["Paladin"],"t":"1 action","r":"Self (30-foot radius)","cp":"V","du":"Up to 10 minutes","d":"An aura moves with you. Friendly creatures within 30 feet, including you, have advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects. When a qualifying successful save would halve damage, the creature instead takes none.","src":"phb-2014","page":221,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Elemental Weapon","l":3,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Paladin"],"t":"1 action","r":"Touch","cp":"VS","du":"Up to 1 hour","d":"Touch a nonmagical weapon. It becomes magical, gains +1 to attack rolls, and deals 1d4 extra acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder damage on a hit. Choose the damage type when you cast.","src":"phb-2014","page":237,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"A slot of level 5–6 grants +2 and 2d4. A slot of level 7 or higher grants +3 and 3d4.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Thunder"},
    {"n":"Summon Aberration","l":4,"s":"Conjuration","c":["Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"90 feet","cp":"VSM","du":"Up to 1 hour","d":"Summon a Beholderkin, Slaad, or Star Spawn spirit in a visible unoccupied space. It uses the Aberrant Spirit stat block from the sourcebook, takes its turn after yours, and follows your spoken commands. It Dodges when given no orders and vanishes at 0 HP or when the spell ends.","src":"tce","page":109,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"Pickled tentacle and eyeball in a platinum-inlaid vial worth at least 400 gp","h":"Use the expended slot’s level for the spirit’s scaling statistics.","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Summon Construct","l":4,"s":"Conjuration","c":["Artificer","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"90 feet","cp":"VSM","du":"Up to 1 hour","d":"Summon a clay, metal, or stone spirit in a visible unoccupied space. It uses the Construct Spirit stat block from the sourcebook, takes its turn after yours, and follows your spoken commands. It Dodges when given no orders and vanishes at 0 HP or when the spell ends.","src":"tce","page":111,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"Ornate stone and metal lockbox worth at least 400 gp","h":"Use the expended slot’s level for the spirit’s scaling statistics.","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Silvery Barbs","l":1,"s":"Enchantment","c":["Bard","Sorcerer","Wizard"],"t":"1 reaction, when a visible creature succeeds on an attack roll, ability check, or saving throw","r":"60 feet","cp":"V","du":"Instantaneous","d":"The triggering creature rerolls the d20 and uses the lower result. Pick a different visible creature in range, including yourself if you choose. It has advantage on its next attack roll, ability check, or saving throw within 1 minute. A creature can hold only one such benefit at a time.","src":"scc","page":38,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Booming Blade","l":0,"s":"Evocation","c":["Artificer","Sorcerer","Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"Self (5-foot radius)","cp":"SM","du":"1 round","d":"Make a melee attack with the component weapon against a creature within 5 feet. A hit applies the attack’s usual effects and envelops the creature in thunder until your next turn starts. If it willingly moves at least 5 feet before then, it takes 1d8 thunder damage and the spell ends.","src":"tce","page":106,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"A melee weapon worth at least 1 sp","h":"At levels 5, 11, and 17 the hit adds 1d8, 2d8, or 3d8 thunder damage, and the movement damage becomes 2d8, 3d8, or 4d8.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Thunder"},
    {"n":"Green-Flame Blade","l":0,"s":"Evocation","c":["Artificer","Sorcerer","Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"Self (5-foot radius)","cp":"SM","du":"Instantaneous","d":"Make a melee attack with the component weapon against a creature within 5 feet. On a hit, deal the attack’s usual effects and optionally deal fire damage equal to your spellcasting modifier to a second visible creature within 5 feet of the first.","src":"tce","page":107,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"A melee weapon worth at least 1 sp","h":"At levels 5, 11, and 17 add 1d8, 2d8, or 3d8 fire damage to both targets.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Fire"},
    {"n":"Create Bonfire","l":0,"s":"Conjuration","c":["Artificer","Druid","Sorcerer","Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"60 feet","cp":"VS","du":"Up to 1 minute","d":"Light a 5-foot cube on a visible patch of ground. Creatures in the cube when you cast, entering it for the first time on their turn, or ending their turn there make a Dexterity save or take 1d8 fire damage. The fire can ignite unattended flammable objects.","src":"xge","page":152,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"Add 1d8 at levels 5, 11, and 17.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Fire","sv":"DEX"},
    {"n":"Lightning Lure","l":0,"s":"Evocation","c":["Artificer","Sorcerer","Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"15 feet (radius)","cp":"V","du":"instantaneous","d":"A visible creature within 15 feet makes a Strength save. On a failure, pull it up to 10 feet in a straight line toward you. If it ends within 5 feet of you, it takes 1d8 lightning damage.","src":"tce","page":107,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"Add 1d8 at levels 5, 11, and 17.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Lightning","sv":"STR"},
    {"n":"Magic Stone","l":0,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Druid","Warlock"],"t":"1 bonus action","r":"touch","cp":"VS","du":"1 minute","d":"Imbue one to three pebbles. A creature may throw a pebble up to 60 feet or use a sling to make a ranged spell attack with it, using your spellcasting modifier. On a hit it deals 1d6 bludgeoning damage plus that modifier. A pebble loses its magic after an attack, and recasting ends the magic on unused pebbles.","src":"xge","page":160,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Bludgeoning","at":"ranged"},
    {"n":"Sword Burst","l":0,"s":"Conjuration","c":["Artificer","Sorcerer","Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"5 feet (radius)","cp":"V","du":"instantaneous","d":"Creatures within 5 feet of you, excluding you, make Dexterity saves. A creature that fails takes 1d6 force damage.","src":"tce","page":115,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"Add 1d6 at levels 5, 11, and 17.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Force","sv":"DEX"},
    {"n":"Thorn Whip","l":0,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Druid"],"t":"1 action","r":"30 feet","cp":"VSM","du":"instantaneous","d":"Make a melee spell attack against a creature within range. On a hit, it takes 1d6 piercing damage. You may pull a Large or smaller target up to 10 feet toward you.","src":"phb-2014","page":282,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"Stem from a thorny plant","h":"Add 1d6 at levels 5, 11, and 17.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Piercing","at":"melee"},
    {"n":"Snare","l":1,"s":"Abjuration","c":["Artificer","Druid","Ranger","Wizard"],"t":"1 minute","r":"touch","cp":"SM","du":"8 hours","d":"Use 25 feet of rope to make a hidden trap in a 5-foot-radius circle. A Small, Medium, or Large creature entering it must succeed on a Dexterity save or hang upside down, restrained. It can retry the save at the end of its turns, or a creature within reach can free it with a successful Arcana check against your spell save DC.","src":"xge","page":165,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"25 feet of rope, consumed","h":"","rulesSummary":true,"sv":"DEX"},
    {"n":"Tasha's Caustic Brew","l":1,"s":"Evocation","c":["Artificer","Sorcerer","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"30 feet (line)","cp":"VSM","du":"Up to 1 minute","d":"Acid streaks out in a line 30 feet long and 5 feet wide. Creatures that fail a Dexterity save are coated and take 2d4 acid damage at the start of each of their turns until the spell ends or an action is used to scrape or wash off the acid.","src":"tce","page":115,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"A bit of rotten food","h":"Add 2d4 per slot level above 1st.","rulesSummary":true,"aliases":["Caustic Brew"],"dt":"Acid","sv":"DEX"},
    {"n":"Pyrotechnics","l":2,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Bard","Sorcerer","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"60 feet","cp":"VS","du":"instantaneous","d":"Extinguish a visible nonmagical flame that fits in a 5-foot cube. Either create a burst that blinds creatures within 10 feet until your next turn ends on a failed Constitution save, or make a heavily obscured 20-foot-radius smoke cloud that lasts up to a minute and disperses in a strong wind.","src":"xge","page":163,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"","rulesSummary":true,"sv":"CON"},
    {"n":"Skywrite","l":2,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Bard","Druid","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"sight","cp":"VS","du":"Up to 1 hour","d":"Write up to ten words in clouds in a part of the sky you can see. The message lasts until the spell ends or strong wind disperses it.","src":"xge","page":165,"co":1,"ri":1,"m":"","h":"","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Catnap","l":3,"s":"Enchantment","c":["Artificer","Bard","Sorcerer","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"30 feet","cp":"SM","du":"10 minutes","d":"Up to three willing creatures you can see fall unconscious for the duration. Damage or an action to wake one ends its sleep early. A creature that sleeps the full ten minutes gains a short rest and must finish a long rest before this spell can benefit it again.","src":"xge","page":151,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"A pinch of sand","h":"Choose one additional creature per slot level above 3rd.","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Flame Arrows","l":3,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Druid","Ranger","Sorcerer","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"touch","cp":"VS","du":"Up to 1 hour","d":"Enchant a quiver of arrows or bolts. A hit with a piece drawn from it deals 1d6 extra fire damage. A piece loses the magic after it is fired, and the spell ends after twelve pieces have been drawn.","src":"xge","page":156,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"Four additional pieces per slot level above 3rd.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Fire"},
    {"n":"Intellect Fortress","l":3,"s":"Abjuration","c":["Artificer","Bard","Sorcerer","Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"30 feet","cp":"V","du":"Up to 1 hour","d":"A willing creature you can see gains resistance to psychic damage and advantage on Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma saving throws.","src":"tce","page":107,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"Choose one additional target per slot level above 3rd. Keep the targets within 30 feet of each other when you cast.","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Tiny Servant","l":3,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Wizard"],"t":"1 minute","r":"touch","cp":"VS","du":"8 hours","d":"Touch a Tiny nonmagical object that is neither attached nor carried to animate it for eight hours. Give it orders with a bonus action while it is within 120 feet. It otherwise defends itself. Use the Tiny Servant statistics from the sourcebook.","src":"xge","page":168,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"Animate two additional objects per slot level above 3rd.","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Elemental Bane","l":4,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Druid","Warlock","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"90 feet","cp":"VS","du":"Up to 1 minute","d":"Choose a visible creature and acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. On a failed Constitution save it loses resistance to the chosen type and takes 2d6 extra damage the first time it takes that type of damage each turn.","src":"xge","page":155,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"Choose one additional target per slot level above 4th. Keep targets within 30 feet of each other.","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Acid, Cold, Fire, Lightning, Thunder","sv":"CON"},
    {"n":"Skill Empowerment","l":5,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Bard","Sorcerer","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"touch","cp":"VS","du":"Up to 1 hour","d":"Touch a willing creature and name a skill in which it is proficient and does not already double its proficiency bonus. It doubles that bonus on checks with the chosen skill while the spell lasts.","src":"xge","page":165,"co":1,"ri":0,"m":"","h":"","rulesSummary":true},
    {"n":"Transmute Rock","l":5,"s":"Transmutation","c":["Artificer","Druid","Wizard"],"t":"1 action","r":"120 feet","cp":"VSM","du":"until ended","d":"Choose up to a 40-foot cube of visible nonmagical rock or mud. Rock turned to mud can slow and restrain creatures or fall from a ceiling. Mud turned to rock can restrain creatures caught in it. Use the sourcebook to resolve the mode, saves, and escapes against this casting’s save DC.","src":"xge","page":169,"co":0,"ri":0,"m":"Clay and water","h":"","rulesSummary":true,"dt":"Bludgeoning","sv":"DEX, STR"}
